      "statement": "The verification loop is pnpm lint (ESLint flat config enforcing the import boundaries), pnpm test (Vitest run over tests/unit/ covering mappers and module domain/ layers with fixed as-of dates; Node 22+ is required because Vitest 4's rolldown crashes at startup on older Node), pnpm exec tsc --noEmit (strict typecheck, no dedicated script), and pnpm test:e2e (Playwright over e2e/ booting pnpm dev, signing in with Clerk test keys pk_test_*/sk_test_* only per .env.example); RLS/tenant-isolation tests, when they exist, run against real Supabase with no mocks and the real-Supabase integration suite is still outstanding.",
